+Feature: Clear completed todos
+  As a user
+  I want to remove all completed todos in one action
+  So that I can keep my list clean
+
+  Background:
+    Given the TodoMVC app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+    Scenario: Clicking Clear completed removes all completed todos
+      Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+      And a completed todo "Buy eggs" exists
+      When the user clicks the Clear completed button
+      Then the todo list contains 1 item
+      And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+    Scenario: The Clear completed button is visible when there are completed todos
+      Given a completed todo "Buy milk" exists
+      Then the Clear completed button is visible
+
+    Scenario: The Clear completed button is hidden when there are no completed todos
+      Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+      Then the Clear completed button is hidden
